; For a normalized log transition, apply the local Jacobian or its transpose
; along the fixed scan itinerary. Slots are initial state, matrix and emissions.
(rewrite (Pullback "terminal log Markov scan" 3 slot) (MarkovScan slot 0) :ruleset pullbacks)
(rewrite (Pushforward "terminal log Markov scan" 3 slot) (MarkovScan slot 1) :ruleset pullbacks)
